+Code, manifests with file hashes and raw timing records are in the project repository \url{https://github.com/reikageisme/Sponge-patch-nms}. The repository contains the preregistration files with their version-control tags, the harness and analysis scripts, the manifests (code hash, library versions, CPU topology and power mode), the hash of every patch, the raw timing records of every run including rejected ones, and the figure scripts. Numeric tables are generated from saved summary files; a checking script compares the generated table text and source registry with a fresh build. Narrative statements, raw-model replay, statistical validity and final document layout require separate checks and are not certified by that table checker.
